IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `era-types`
IMPORT `era-access`
IMPORT `era-grievance`

-- Employment Relations Act 2000 — THE TOP-LEVEL GOAL.
--
--   "For a dismissed employee's personal grievance: may it be brought, was it
--    raised in time, by when must proceedings be commenced, and what
--    remedies are available?"

§ `The top-level goal`

DECLARE `Grievance position` HAS
    `barred by a trial provision or the threshold`      IS A BOOLEAN
    `raised in time`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `last day to raise`                                 IS A DATE
    `last day to commence an action`                    IS A DATE
    `reinstatement and compensation available`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `reimbursement to be ordered`                       IS A NUMBER

@ref ss 67A-67B, 67I-67J, 113A-113B, 114, 123B-124, 128
@export default A personal grievance's position under the Employment Relations Act 2000 (NZ): whether a trial provision or the high-earner threshold bars it (ss 67B, 113A); whether it was raised in time and the last day to raise it (s 114); the last day to commence proceedings (s 114(6)); whether reinstatement and compensation are available given the employee's contribution (ss 123B-123C); and the reimbursement the Authority must order if it succeeds (ss 124, 128). Nothing is available if the grievance is barred. DRAFT, not reviewed by a New Zealand lawyer.
GIVEN e IS AN Employment  @desc The employment, trial provision, notice, remuneration and threshold
      g IS A Grievance  @desc The ground, dates of the action and of raising it, consent and leave
      r IS A `Remedy facts`  @desc Contribution, serious misconduct, reduction, lost and 3 months' ordinary time remuneration
GIVETH A `Grievance position`
`the grievance position for` e `, grievance` g `, remedies` r MEANS
    `Grievance position` WITH
        `barred by a trial provision or the threshold`  IS barred
        `raised in time`                                IS `the grievance was raised in time` g
        `last day to raise`                             IS `the last day to raise the grievance` g
        `last day to commence an action`                IS `the last day to commence an action on a grievance raised on` (g's `grievance raised on`) `, Matariki days` (g's `Matariki Observance Days`)
        `reinstatement and compensation available`      IS (NOT barred) AND `reinstatement and compensation are available` r
        `reimbursement to be ordered`                   IS IF barred THEN 0 ELSE `the reimbursement the Authority must order` r
    WHERE
        barred MEANS `the grievance is barred` e g
